%% Simple site + RAYZA — who does what. Arrows point from who acts to what changes.
%% Detail: 01-guest, 02-manager (staff); deployment: 06-tech-netlify-setup.
%% Everything hotel-side (front desk, F&B, restaurant, housekeeping, Booking.com
%% and other channels, rates) lives in RAYZA. The website only sells rooms.
flowchart TB
    classDef guest fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#0c4a6e
    classDef staff fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef tech fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef system fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827
    classDef ext fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#3b0764

    Guest["Guest<br/>books online"]:::guest
    Staff["Staff<br/>online bookings view"]:::staff
    Hotel["Hotel team<br/>front desk, F&B, OTAs"]:::staff

    Rayza["RAYZA<br/>rooms, rates, availability,<br/>all bookings"]:::ext
    Quote["Quote<br/>RAYZA price × nights"]:::system
    Reserve["Race-safe hold<br/>reserve_room_capped"]:::system
    Manage["Manage-booking link"]:::system
    Res[("Website reservations + payments")]:::system

    Paystack["Paystack<br/>card + Pay with Transfer"]:::ext
    Moniepoint["Moniepoint"]:::ext
    Resend["Resend email"]:::ext

    Hotel --> Rayza
    Rayza -->|"GET /v1/rooms"| Quote
    Guest -->|"search + quote"| Quote
    Guest -->|"book"| Reserve --> Res
    Guest -->|"pay"| Paystack -->|"webhook"| Res
    Moniepoint -->|"webhook"| Res
    Staff -->|"record transfer, retry, cancel"| Res
    Res -->|"paid → POST /v1/bookings<br/>cancelled → cancel"| Rayza
    Guest -->|"view / pay / cancel"| Manage --> Res
    Res -->|"booking + receipt emails"| Resend

    Tech["Tech person: Netlify env vars (RAYZA_*), migrations 022/024/025,<br/>CRON_SECRET, webhooks — see 06"]:::tech
